WEBVTT

00:03:59.076 --> 00:04:01.603
consumers are increasingly disconnected

00:04:01.627 --> 00:04:04.385
with their farmers and the economics
of food production.

00:04:04.906 --> 00:04:07.221
Since the rise of
the smartphone revolution,

00:04:07.245 --> 00:04:10.058
direct-to-consumer goods have stagnated.

00:04:12.081 --> 00:04:17.208
While local and sustainable foods
have been trending for almost a decade,

00:04:17.232 --> 00:04:19.209
terms like "healthy" and "natural"

00:04:19.233 --> 00:04:21.721
have no legal framework
in the United States.

00:04:22.371 --> 00:04:26.088
Your best bet for fresh,
nutrient-rich foods

00:04:26.112 --> 00:04:27.675
without the marketing jargon?

00:04:28.378 --> 00:04:29.733
Go to your farmers market.